      "side": 1,
      "message": "well, nothing prevents the caller from saying \"increment RMA count by 3\" for a single RMA, which will also lead to an inaccurate number of RMAs recorded (though, in the opposite direction).\nnot sure if knowing that we had X or more RMAs is that important if we don\u0027t enforce tracking those precisely.",
